{"format":"local-vault-ai-portable-chunks-v1","version":1,"chunks":[{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Data Jurisdiction.md::0","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Data Jurisdiction.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"data jurisdiction data jurisdiction","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Data Jurisdiction.md","fileName":"Data Jurisdiction.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Data Jurisdiction","heading":"Document","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"2026-09-08 22:39\n\nStatus: #baby\n\nTags: [[Cloud Security and Data Protection]]","tags":["baby"],"links":["Cloud Security and Data Protection","cloudcomputing_mit.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Data Jurisdiction.md::1","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Data Jurisdiction.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"data jurisdiction data jurisdiction","filePath":"6 - Full Notes/Data Jurisdiction.md","fileName":"Data Jurisdiction.md","folder":"6 - Full Notes","title":"Data Jurisdiction","heading":"Data Jurisdiction","sectionNumber":"","sectionTitle":"","content":"Data jurisdiction identifies the laws and regulatory authority that apply to data and the systems or people handling it. A cloud provider, user, application host, storage location, and support team may each be located in a different country.\n\nThe applicable jurisdiction should therefore be established before a service is purchased, not inferred only from the consumer's location. Geographic movement caused by elastic provisioning must remain compatible with the service's legal and compliance requirements.","tags":["baby"],"links":["Cloud Security and Data Protection","cloudcomputing_mit.epub"],"properties":[],"pageStart":0,"pageEnd":0,"embeddingF32":""},{"id":"6 - Full Notes/Data Jurisdiction.md::2","sourceKey":"6 - Full Notes/Data Jurisdiction.md","sourceType":"markdown","sectionKey":"__none__","sourceSearchName":"data jurisdiction data jurisdiction","filePath